  ],
  "correction": "PowerShell exact ProcessStartInfo.FileName, UseShellExecute=false, explicit Process.ExitCode, independently drained bounded stdout/stderr bytes; Node explicit spawnSync.status with bounded buffers. Identity validation, fail-closed unobserved exits and immutable per-invocation captures. No implicit native invocation or LASTEXITCODE in repaired PS wrapper.",
